{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab View grades and feedback\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Participate in course discussions\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Communicate with your instructor and classmates\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 For technical assistance with Blackboard, contact the ITS Service Center at 315.443.2677 or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:help@syr.edu"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
help@syr.edu
}}}
.\par}
